sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Editor as Segmentation Editor
    participant Scene
    participant Modifier as Segment Modifier
    participant UndoStack

    Note over App, UndoStack: Editor creation
    App ->> Editor: SegmentationEditor(scene, logic, view_manager)
    Editor ->> Scene: Add segment editor node (singleton)
    Editor ->> Editor: Create segment editor logic
    loop For each builtin effect
        Editor ->> Editor: Register effect type
    end
    Editor ->> Editor: Register pipeline creator

    Note over App, UndoStack: Set active segmentation
    App ->> Editor: set_active_segmentation(segmentation_node, volume_node)
    Editor ->> Scene: Set reference image geometry from volume node
    Editor ->> Modifier: Create(Segmentation(segmentation_node, volume_node))
    Editor ->> Editor: Connect segmentation modified
    Editor ->> Editor: Set first segment as active
    Editor ->> UndoStack: Clear (if an undo stack is set)
    Editor ->> Editor: Deactivate active effect (NoTool)
    Editor ->> App: Trigger all signals
